      "question": "Why might a company's stock price drop significantly even if its quarterly financial results are released?",
      "quote": "If any of this occurs, the trading price of our stock could fall substantially, either suddenly or over time. We may fail to meet our publicly announced guidance or other expectations about our business, which could cause our stock price to decline.",
