      "type": "conceptual",
      "split": "confirmation",
      "question": "How might the company's internal governance rules and state laws prevent a new owner from buying the business?",
      "quote": "Anti-takeover provisions contained in our governing documents, applicable laws and certain of our debt facilities could impair a takeover attempt. Our certificate of formation and bylaws afford certain rights and powers to our board of directors that may facilitate the delay or prevention of an acquisition that it deems undesirable.",
      "page": 30
