      "question": "Under what specific condition does Tesla consider a securities transaction to be based on material nonpublic information?",
      "quote": "Transactions will be considered \u201con the basis of\u201d material nonpublic information if the person engaged in the transaction was aware of the material nonpublic information at the time of the transaction.",
