      "question": "Under what specific circumstances can a person transfer their company shares to a trust without violating trading restrictions?",
      "quote": "Transactions that involve merely a change in the form in which you own securities are not subject to the trading restrictions under this Policy. For example, you may transfer shares to an inter vivos trust of which you are the sole beneficiary during your lifetime.",
